WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.300
-Welcome, everybody!

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.734
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everyone.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.133
You're here. You made it.
Thank you.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.133
Thank you for watching at home.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.300
I appreciate it.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.467
Well, guys,
some big business news.

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.767
Today, JetBlue announced
they reached a deal

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.000
to buy Spirit Airlines.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.868
-Ooh!
-Yes.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.501
JetBlue and Spirit.

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:22.868
It's the
perfect marriage between

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:24.434
broken TVs and broken planes.

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:27.467
It's unbelievable.
It's -- That's right.

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.234
Spirit agreed to
a deal with JetBlue

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:32.534
and cancelled their merger
with Frontier Airlines.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:34.868
Today, Frontier was like,
"Well, it's Spirit.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.434
How did we not see
this cancellation coming?"

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.601
Some news from Washington.

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:43.767
President Biden
is celebrating a huge win

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.367
after Senator Joe Manchin
suddenly agreed

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.834
to support his
climate and economic bill,

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:51.000
meaning it will now
most likely pass.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:58.033
This is a
huge victory for Biden.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.400
In fact,
right after the announcement,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.934
his approval rating
skyrocketed to 11%.

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:04.434
-Oh.
-That's right.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:06.200
-Switching gears,
apparently, this year,

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.601
Hershey doesn't think that
they're going to be able to meet

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.601
the demand for Halloween.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.334
On a related story,

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:16.534
Biden's approval rating
just fell back under 10%.

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:17.601
Did you guys see this?

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.501
In an effort to be
more eco-friendly,

00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:22.033
Coca-Cola announced
that sprite will no longer

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.267
be sold in green bottles.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.434
Most Americans
heard and were like,

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.901
"Damn, that was the
only green thing in my diet."

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:34.367
That's right.
Everyone had the same reaction.

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:36.534
They're like, "Make the bottle
whatever color you want.

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:38.634
It's all getting filled with
vodka anyway, alright?

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:40.400
Oh!

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.534
-Ooh!
-Hey! Hey!

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:47.000
-Make a noise.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.400
Fill it up.
-That's right.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.968
Sprite's getting rid of
the green bottles

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.901
'cause they're not
environmentally friendly.

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:53.033
I guess this that
explains this new ad I saw.

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:54.167
Watch this.

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:56.634
-Health-Ade Kombucha
is proud to announce

00:01:56.634 --> 00:02:00.200
our new all-natural,
completely waste-free bottle...

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.367
Kevin's hands.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:04.400
Yep, no bottle, no can,
just Kevin.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:07.400
Find him and lap it up
out of his hands like a dog.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.067
That's how it works now.

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:11.834
Health-Ade Kombucha --
it's in Kevin's hands now.

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:13.834
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.467
Yeah.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:20.534
Well, get this --
a new viral TikTok trend.

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:23.000
People are dropping jalapeños
in their wine

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.601
and calling it spicy rosé.

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:26.501
-Come on! Please.

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:28.434
That's not a new viral trend.

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:30.601
I've been drinking
spicy rosé for years.

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:32.200
-Oh, really?
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.634
But I like mine extra spicy.

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.467
-Oh.

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:38.934
-Here.
Let me show you how I do it.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:40.501
♪♪

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:44.234
First, you take any glass of
rosé, any old glass of rosé.

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:48.367
Then you simply add a
few squirts of Frank's RedHot.

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:49.901
-Oh, man.
-Just a little bit.

00:02:49.901 --> 00:02:51.067
-I don't know.
I don't know. Okay.

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:52.934
-Little bit.
Just a little something.

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:55.734
Then you've got to take a little
bit of Tabasco, right?

00:02:55.734 --> 00:02:57.067
Little Tabasco sauce,

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:58.133
just a couple squirts.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:02:59.868
Little bit,
just something light.

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.667
Then you need
a little Sriracha, right?

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:03.400
You got to really hit it
with that Sriracha.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.100
-Oh, my goodness.
-Yeah.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.467
-Alright, alright. Yeah.
-Little bit of Sriracha, right?

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:10.267
Yeah, a few red-pepper flakes --
right? -- for the rim.

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:14.334
And then you garnish it with
a Carolina reaper.

00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:15.701
Voilà!

00:03:15.701 --> 00:03:18.667
-Wow! And you drink that?

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:21.067
-Hell yeah. Cheers.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:28.167
-How does it --
how does it taste?

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:29.601
[ Flames whooshing ]

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:35.601
-♪ I will remember you ♪

00:03:35.601 --> 00:03:39.200
♪ Will you remember me? ♪

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.400
-Oh, my gosh.
-That's a shame.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.734
-He loved his spicy rosé.
-Yep, he's a spicy personality.

00:03:45.734 --> 00:03:48.200
-He's very spicy.
-Yeah, moving on...

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.501 --> 00:03:55.634
My favorite --
-He drank it again.

00:03:55.634 --> 00:03:58.167
-No, my favorite is that
Questlove can't laugh because

00:03:58.167 --> 00:04:00.934
he got Novocain
on the side of his face.

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:03.467
It's the funniest thing
I've ever seen.

00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:05.734
-Ugh!

00:04:05.734 --> 00:04:07.067
-Hey, this is fun.

00:04:07.067 --> 00:04:08.400
Today is
National Water Park Day.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.400
-Hey!

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.000
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.200
There are so many great
water parks out there,

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.167
and I just saw this interesting
promo to celebrate them.

00:04:15.167 --> 00:04:16.400
Take a look at this.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.467
-Happy National Water Park Day,
a day that honors

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:22.200
all our country's amazing
water parks, like...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.901
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.901 --> 00:04:41.634
I'm excited.

00:04:44.334 --> 00:04:46.267
Well, everyone's
talking about this.

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:47.567
In just a few minutes,

00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:51.467
Beyoncé is releasing
her new album, "Renaissance."

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:53.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:56.133
Which means, tomorrow,

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:58.300
all banks and government
buildings will be closed.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.534
Yeah.

00:04:59.534 --> 00:05:01.400
Speaking of Beyoncé's new album,
it was actually

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.934
leaked yesterday,
and her fan base, the Beyhive,

00:05:03.934 --> 00:05:05.267
is pretty upset about it.

00:05:05.267 --> 00:05:07.200
-Yes, we are.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.901
So rude.
Really made my blood boil.

00:05:09.901 --> 00:05:11.767
-You're in the Beyhive?

00:05:11.767 --> 00:05:13.300
-Uh, yeah.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.601
Member since "Sasha Fierce."

00:05:16.167 --> 00:05:20.667
What? You don't expect me
to love music or

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:23.400
appreciate a queen
wearing her crown?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:27.467
-No, I just didn't know that
we were...

00:05:27.467 --> 00:05:29.267
both members.

00:05:29.267 --> 00:05:31.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:37.868 --> 00:05:39.234
Well, this is cool.

00:05:39.234 --> 00:05:42.067
MTV has added a category for
Best Metaverse Performance

00:05:42.067 --> 00:05:43.434
to the VMAs.

00:05:43.434 --> 00:05:45.367
Yeah.
Best Metaverse Performance.

00:05:45.367 --> 00:05:46.901
There are so many great artists
who have performed

00:05:46.901 --> 00:05:48.467
in the Metaverse this year,

00:05:48.467 --> 00:05:50.601
so there's gonna be
some competition.

00:05:50.601 --> 00:05:51.934
Yeah, check out this concert

00:05:51.934 --> 00:05:53.334
Post Malone did
in the Metaverse.

00:05:53.334 --> 00:05:54.434
-Oh.
-Yeah.

00:05:54.434 --> 00:05:57.767
♪♪

00:05:57.767 --> 00:05:58.834
-[ Robotic voice ] Hello.

00:05:58.834 --> 00:06:01.667
I am going to do
singing of my song now.

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:02.968
Activate music.

00:06:02.968 --> 00:06:04.434
♪♪

00:06:04.434 --> 00:06:06.467
♪ Let's have fun time tonight ♪

00:06:06.467 --> 00:06:08.534
♪ Baby, you are my wife ♪

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:09.834
♪ Hello ♪

00:06:09.834 --> 00:06:11.968
-[ Squawking ]

00:06:11.968 --> 00:06:14.634
-Thank you. I did the music.

00:06:14.634 --> 00:06:15.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:18.701 --> 00:06:20.200
-Wow.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.801
-Hey, I heard about
a man in Florida

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:26.234
who was arrested for a D.U.I.
at Walmart

00:06:26.234 --> 00:06:29.734
after he crashed a motorized
scooter into the shelves.

00:06:29.734 --> 00:06:30.801
Wait a second.

00:06:30.801 --> 00:06:33.868
Walmart, drunk,
scooter crash, arrested.

00:06:33.868 --> 00:06:36.400
Bingo! I got Florida bingo!
I got it! Yeah!

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:38.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:06:40.501 --> 00:06:42.167
Awesome.

00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:45.334
And, finally, Fancy Feast is
opening up a pop-up restaurant
in

00:06:45.334 --> 00:06:48.834
New York City that will serve
cat-food-inspired dishes.

00:06:48.834 --> 00:06:51.868
When you sit down,
the waiter is like,

00:06:51.868 --> 00:06:53.734
"Sparkling, still,
or from the toilet?"

00:06:53.734 --> 00:06:54.801
We have a great show, everyone.

